      "sourceTextSha256": "7f3a3848a683d030a2de5ed3742700debdde749fbd3cf1cb46fa9fd322c1047c",
      "text": "Transfer to Rio de Janeiro. Arrival at Rio de Janeiro Airport. You will be met by your guide at the airport. Transfer to the hotel.  Rio is green hills, blue skies, rocky mountains, coves, islands, beautiful beaches... the second largest (after São Paulo) city in Brazil and, of course, one of the most beautiful cities in the world. If you arrive before dawn, you will see green hills, rocky mountains, palm trees on both sides of the road and beautiful bays on the way from the airport. At nightfall, the city is surrounded by a shimmering necklace - these are the lights of the favelas! We spend the rest of the day at our discretion. Maybe someone will want to see and feel the exuberant life of the city as soon as possible. And someone wants to be alone with themselves, then there is always a corner for this somewhere between palm trees, sand and ocean waves.\n\n Overnight at Copacabana Palace A Belmond Hotel Rio de Janeiro, 1 Bedroom Double Suite with pool view, BB",
